{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_044940","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你熟悉云雾林吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不算熟。不过，同样是热带森林，热带雨林和被雾笼罩的云雾林完全是两回事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"共同点嘛……对了，小心箭毒蛙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"热带雨林和云雾林都一样湿度很高，对箭毒蛙来说是最理想的环境。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不过，草莓箭毒蛙和染色箭毒蛙光是摸一下倒不至于死人，可就算饿了也别吃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Mother Base能准备口粮。这次应该不至于太缺食物。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真的？吃不到野生动物，你不会觉得遗憾吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Chico，你把我当什么人了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"哈哈，开玩笑的。不过听说哥伦比亚那边有一种箭毒蛙，光碰一下都很危险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"你知道得还真详细。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是啊。有毒的生物，不觉得很帅吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"真中毒了，可就不是帅不帅的问题了吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"知道啦。对了，到了森林以后，也帮我留意一下有没有Bigfoot。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那个看来不用特意留意了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""}]}